lse Prophet           +\n                                                                                    +\n > I. The Sun-clothed Woman (Rev. 12:1-6, 13-17)                                    +\n                                                                                    +\n > II. The Manchild—Various Interpretations                                         +\n                                                                                    +\n > III. The Manchild—the True Interpretation                                        +\n                                                                                    +\n > IV. The Dragon (Rev. 12:1-17; 13:1-4; 16:13-16; 20:1-10)                         +\n                                                                                    +\n > V. The War in Heaven (Rev. 12:7-12)                                              +\n                                                                                    +\n > VI. The Remnant of the Woman (Rev. 12:17)                                        +\n                                                                                    +\n > Questions on Lesson Forty-five                                                   +\n                                                                                    +\n Lesosn 46: The Beasts Out of the Sea and Earth                                     +\n                                                                                    +\n > I. The Beast Out of the Sea (Rev. 13:1-10, 18)                                   +\n                                                                                    +\n > II. The Beast Out of the Earth (Rev. 13:11-17)                                   +\n                                                                                    +\n > Questions on Lesson Forty-six                                                    +\n                                                             